</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.36</h2><ul><li><strong>Zhipu and z.ai reset cards take one row.</strong> With Reset cards on under Settings → Providers → Zhipu or z.ai → Panel — on by default — the usage card shows how many 5-hour and weekly cards are left and when the next one expires, and the explanation and the confirmation open from that row&#x27;s mark. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/98">#98</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.36">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
